<title>UK: Eurotunnel Q3 turnover rises.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel Q3 turnover rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-French channel tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA/Plc said on Wednesday its turnover rose to 138.41 million stg in the third quarter compared with 81.27 million stg in the year-ago period.  </p>
<p>For the nine months ended September 30, turnover increased to 362.1 million stg from 185.8 million stg.</p>
<p>Eurotunnel's shares were marked up one pence at 91.5p at 0810 in London.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
